    "solution": "<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Given Sequence:&nbsp;_ _ VZ _ V _&nbsp;V _ ZV _ _ V _</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Now, putting the letters in the blank spaces&nbsp;given in the option one by one:</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Option 1)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">VZVVZZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr; <b><u>V</u></b><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<b><u>Z</u></b>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u>&nbsp;V / <b><u>V</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Option 2)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">VZZVVZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<b><u>Z</u></b>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><strong>Option 3)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">ZVVZVVZV</span></strong><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr; <u><strong>Z</strong></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<u><strong>V</strong></u>&nbsp;V / Z <u><strong>V</strong></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V </span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V </span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\"><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Here, &#39;</span>ZVV<span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&#39; followed a pattern.</span></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Option 4)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">ZVZZVZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 3&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">यहाँ अनुसरण किया गया तर्क निम्न है:</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">दिया गया अनुक्रम:&nbsp;_ _ VZ _ V _&nbsp;V _ ZV _ _ V _</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">अब विकल्प में दिए गए रिक्त स्थानों पर अक्षरों को एक-एक करके रखने पर:</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">विकल्प 1)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">VZVVZZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr; <b><u>V</u></b><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<b><u>Z</u></b>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u>&nbsp;V / <b><u>V</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp;</span>2)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">VZZVVZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<b><u>Z</u></b>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V <b><u>Z</u></b></span></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp;</span>3)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">ZVVZVVZV</span></strong><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr; <u><strong>Z</strong></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<u><strong>V</strong></u>&nbsp;V / Z <u><strong>V</strong></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V </span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V </span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">यहाँ, &#39;ZVV&#39;&nbsp;एक पैटर्न का अनुसरण करता है।</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp;</span>4)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">ZVZZVZZZ</span><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"--darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">&nbsp;</span>&rarr;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u>&nbsp;V / Z&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u>&nbsp;V /&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">V</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/ Z V <b><u>Z</u></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;V&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Z</span></u></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">अतः, सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;विकल्प 3&quot;</strong> है।</p>\n",
