  {
    "question": "<p>Which letter will replace the question mark (?) in the following series?</p>\n\n<p>T, U, ?, X, N, C, H, J</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>निम्नलिखित श्रृंखला में प्रश्नवाचक चिन्ह (?) के स्थान पर कौन सा अक्षर आएगा?</p>\n\n<p>T, U, ?, X, N, C, H, J</p>\n",
    "options": [
      "W",
      "P",
      "R",
      "V",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "W",
      "P",
      "R",
      "V",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/01/alphabets.PNG\" style=\"width: 597px; height: 131px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Given series: T, U, ?, X, N, C, H, J</p>\n\n<p>The series is divided into two different parts &ndash; letters at odd position and letters at even position.</p>\n\n<p>U + 3 = X; X + 5 = C; C + 7 = J</p>\n\n<p><strong>T &ndash; 2 = R</strong>; R &ndash; 4 = N; N &ndash; 6 = H</p>\n\n<p>Hence, &lsquo;R&rsquo; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/01/alphabets.PNG\" style=\"width: 597px; height: 131px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>अनुसरित स्वरुप इस प्रकार है:</p>\n\n<p>दी गई श्रृंखला: T, U, ?, X, N, C, H, J</p>\n\n<p>श्रृंखला को दो अलग-अलग भागों में विभाजित किया गया है &ndash; विषम स्थान पर अक्षर और सम स्थान पर अक्षर।</p>\n\n<p>U + 3 = X; X + 5 = C; C + 7 = J</p>\n\n<p><strong>T &ndash; 2 = R</strong>; R &ndash; 4 = N; N &ndash; 6 = H</p>\n\n<p>अतः, &lsquo;R&rsquo; सही उत्तर है।<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
    "marks": "1"
  },
