    "question": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p>\n\n<p>13, 14, 23, 48, 97, 178, ?</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>निम्नलिखित में से कौन सी संख्या दी गई श्रेणी में प्रश्न&nbsp;चिह्न (?) को प्रतिस्थापित करेगी?</p>\n\n<p>13, 14, 23, 48, 97, 178, ?</p>\n",
    "options": [
      "259",
      "278",
      "269",
      "299",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "259",
      "278",
      "269",
      "299",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 4,
    "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Addition of the square of the odd number to previous number to get next number in the series.</p>\n\n<p>13 +<span style=\"\">&nbsp;<strong>1<sup>2</sup></strong>&nbsp;=13 + 1 =&nbsp;<strong>14</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>14 +<strong> 3</strong><sup><strong>2</strong>&nbsp;</sup>= 14 + 9 =&nbsp;<strong>23</strong></p>\n\n<p>23 +<strong> 5<sup>2</sup></strong>&nbsp;= 23 + 25 =<strong> 48&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>48 +&nbsp;<strong>7<sup>2</sup></strong>&nbsp;= 48 + 49 =&nbsp;<strong>97</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>97 +&nbsp;<strong>9<sup>2</sup></strong>&nbsp;= 97 + 81 =&nbsp;<strong>178</strong></p>\n\n<p>178 +&nbsp;<strong>11<sup>2</sup></strong>&nbsp;= 178 + 121 =&nbsp;<strong>299</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct option is<strong> 299</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क इस प्रकार&nbsp;है:</p>\n\n<p>विषम संख्या के वर्ग को पिछली संख्या में जोड़ने पर श्रृंखला में अगली संख्या प्राप्त होती है।</p>\n\n<p>13 + <span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">1<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span></span>= 13 + 1 = <strong>14</strong></p>\n\n<p>14 + <span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">3</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">2</span>&nbsp;</span>= 14 + 9 = <strong>23</strong></p>\n\n<p>23 + <span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">5<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>= 23 + 25 = <strong>48</strong></p>\n\n<p>48 + <strong>7</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \"><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>= 48 + 49 = <strong>97</strong></p>\n\n<p>97 + <span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">9<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>= 97 + 81 = <strong>178</strong></p>\n\n<p>178 + <span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">11<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>= 178 + 121 = <strong>299</strong></p>\n\n<p>अतः सही विकल्प <strong>299&nbsp;</strong>है<span style=\"\">।</span></p>\n",
    "marks": "1"
  },
