    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p><span style=\"\">According to the English alphabets &amp; their positional values:</span><br style=\"\" />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage102.png\" style=\"\" /><br style=\"\" />\n<span style=\"\">The pattern followed is:<br />\n<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;First alphabet is increased by 1 at odd steps &amp; by 2 at even steps.<br />\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Second alphabet is increased by the difference of 2 at odd steps &amp; decrease by the difference of 2&nbsp;at even steps.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_SSC_Ishita_17.02.23_D1.png\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 493px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence the correct answer is <strong>option 3.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F2_SSC_Arbaz_14-7-23_Prashant_D1_V2.png\" style=\"height: 132px; width: 367px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence the correct answer is&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">option 3.</span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला और उनके स्थितीय मान के अनुसार:<br style=\"\" />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage102.png\" style=\"\" /></p>\n\n<p>निम्न पैटर्न का अनुसरण किया गया है:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>पहले अक्षर को एकान्तर रूप से पहले +1 और फिर +2 से बढ़ाया&nbsp;जाता है।</strong></li>\n\t<li><strong>दूसरे अक्षर में दो शृंखलाएँ हैं। पहली शृंखला में -2 किया जाता है तथा दूसरी शृंखला में +2 किया जाता है।&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_SSC_Ishita_17.02.23_D1.png\" style=\" width: 199px; height: 493px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>अतः सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 3</strong> है।</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F2_SSC_Arbaz_14-7-23_Prashant_D1_V2.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); height: 132px; width: 367px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">अतः सही उत्तर&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">विकल्प 3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;है।</span></p>\n",
    "marks": "1"
