    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p>The pattern is: Divide by 2 then subtract by 2.</p>\n\n<p>380 &divide; 2 = 190 &ndash; 2 = 188</p>\n\n<p>188 &divide; 2 = 94 &ndash; 2 = 92</p>\n\n<p>92 &divide; 2 = 46 &ndash; 2 = <strong>44 not 48</strong></p>\n\n<p>44 &divide; 2 = 22 &ndash; 2 = 20</p>\n\n<p>20 &divide; 2 = 10 &ndash; 2 = 8</p>\n\n<p>8 &divide; 2 = 4 &ndash; 2 = 2</p>\nHence the wrong number is 48.",
