    "question": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p>\n\n<p>6, 16, 29, 62, 121, ?</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>निम्नलिखित में से कौन सी संख्या दी गई शृंखला में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) को प्रतिस्थापित करेगी?</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">6, 16, 29, 62, 121, ?</span></p>\n",
    "options": [
      "<span style=\"\">283</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">246</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">238</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">264</span>",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "283",
      "246",
      "238",
      "264",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 2,
    "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>6 &times; 2&nbsp; + 4 = 16</p>\n\n<p>16 &times; 2 - 3 = 29</p>\n\n<p>29 &times; 2 + 4 = 62</p>\n\n<p>62 &times; 2 - 3 = 121&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>121&nbsp;&times; 2 + 4 =&nbsp;<strong>246</strong></p>\n<span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&quot;246&quot;.</span>",
    "solution_hi": "<p>यहाँ अनुसरण किया गया पैटर्न&nbsp;है:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">6 &times; 2&nbsp; + 4 = 16</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">16 &times; 2 - 3 = 29</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">29 &times; 2 + 4 = 62</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">62 &times; 2 - 3 = 121&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">121&nbsp;&times; 2 + 4 =&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">246</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">अत:, सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;246</strong>&quot; है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "1"
  },
