    "question": "<p>Which of the following letters will replace the question mark (?) and complete the following letter series?</p>\n\n<p>D, B, X, R, J, ?</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p><span style=\"\">निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा अक्षर प्रश्न चिह्न (?) को प्रतिस्थापित करेगा और निम्नलिखित अक्षर शृंखला को पूरा करेगा?</span></p>\n\n<p>D, B, X, R, J, ?</p>\n",
    "options": [
      "A",
      "Y",
      "Z",
      "X",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "A",
      "Y",
      "Z",
      "X",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The positional values of English alphabet is as follows:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/alphabet.png\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 149px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">D - 2 = B</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">B - 4&nbsp;=&nbsp; X {Alphabet series end with Z = 26. If we take 4 steps back, then it will be X.}&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">X - 6 = R</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">R - 8 = J</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">J - 10 = Z&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Z&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"\">अंग्रेजी वर्णाक्षरों के स्थितीय मान निम्नलिखित है:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/alphabet.png\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 149px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">D - 2 = B</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">B - 4&nbsp;=&nbsp; X {<span style=\"\">वर्णमाला शृंखला&nbsp;Z = 26 पर समाप्त होती है।</span> <span style=\"\">यदि हम 4 चरण पीछे आते हैं, तो यह X होगा।</span>}&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">X - 6 = R</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">R - 8 = J</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">J - 10 = Z&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"\">अतः&nbsp;सही उत्तर<strong> &quot;Z&quot;</strong> है।</span></p>\n",
    "marks": "1"
